        "CLIP~\\cite{DBLP:conf/icml/RadfordKHRGASAM21} $\\triangle$  & 11.1      & 34.5      & 50.5     & 9.7       & 29.8     & 43.0     & 19.4    & 40.2   & 49.3   \\\\ \n",
