            "Taking the $\\rm i^{th}$ layer in the visual backbone as an example, we denote the predefined prefix vector as $\\bm X_{Pr}^i\\in \\bm \\Re^{l\\times d}$ and the visual features obtained from the $(i-1)^{th}$ layer is $\\bm H_I^{i-1}\\in \\bm \\Re^{l\\times d}$, we acquire the object-aware prefix vector via simply addition as Eq.~\\ref{eq4},\n",
