            "\\subsubsection{Implementation Details}\n",
            "\n",
            "In our main experiments, we use ViT-L/14 from pre-trained CLIP~\\cite{DBLP:conf/icml/RadfordKHRGASAM21} as the image encoder and LLaMa-7b~\\cite{touvron2023llama} as the text encoder. We use YOLOv7~\\cite{wang2022yolov7} to obtain bounding boxes, keeping the top 5 most confident objects for images with excessive objects.\n",
