            "\n",
            "As shown in Tab~\\ref{mainexp}, we conduct a comparative analysis of our model against baseline approaches across three benchmarks, varying in KB sizes from 112K to 21M. \n",
            "Evidently, our proposed approach consistently outperforms the leading state-of-the-art baselines across all evaluated metrics.\n",
