            "\n",
            "\n",
            "\n",
            "\n",
            "\n",
            "\n",
            "\n",
            "Besides, ReViz-ICT, which utilizes a single-stream query encoder to capture cross-modal interactions, consistently achieves superior performance among other baselines. The lower performance of other baseline models,\n",
